  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mapping youth agri-entrepreneurs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to analyse and map the youth entrepreneurship ecosystem in the horticultural value chain in the Niayes region in Senegal. This will serve as a basis for the Youth Employment &amp; Entrepreneurship team (YEET) activities that will be developed later this year.The Niayes region was selected within the framework of the combi-track. Youth is an important focus in the combi-track. This mapping will provide concrete plans to support youth (agri-)entrepreneurs in the Niayes region and to improve the ecosystem.This project is focusing on economic perspectives for (female) youth entrepreneurs.</narrative>
  </description>
